{"term":"preview","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:2559203bb290246329","definition":"An experience of something in advance.","example":"It is tempting to speculate about the incentives or compulsions that might explain why anyone would take to the skies in [the] basket [of a balloon]: perhaps out of a desire to escape the gravity of this world or to get a preview of the next; […].","pos":"noun","synonyms":["foretaste"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["postpreview","preview-quality","sneak preview"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/preview#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:4b13c56008748ce955","definition":"An advance showing of a film, exhibition etc.","example":"","pos":"noun","synonyms":["forelook","foreview"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"colloquial","register":"colloquial","wordFamily":["postpreview","preview-quality","sneak preview"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/preview#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:a900dae5135f0cac12","definition":"A short collection of clips edited together to advertise a film, television show, etc.; a trailer.","example":"","pos":"noun","synonyms":["forelook","foreview"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["postpreview","preview-quality","sneak preview"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/preview#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:fb65df1c3601ca7ee4","definition":"The act of seeing something in advance.","example":"","pos":"noun","synonyms":["forelook","foreview"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["postpreview","preview-quality","sneak preview"],"source":"English Wiktionary vi